{{IF_CLIENT_PACKAGING}}
Output: `build/{{APP_NAME}}/{{APP_NAME}}.exe`

## Installer

Inno Setup 6.3 or later must be installed. Its location is discovered from the uninstall registry, PATH, and the default install locations, so either a per-machine or a per-user installation works.

```powershell
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File build\Installer.ps1
```

Output: `build/Installer/{{APP_NAME}}-Setup-<version>.exe` (version comes from `<Version>` in `Directory.Build.props`)
{{END_IF}}
{{IF_NO_CLIENT_PACKAGING}}
Output: `build/{{APP_NAME}}/` (publish output for the runtime named by `-Runtime`, default `win-x64`)
{{END_IF}}

